### Create an assignment
POST http://localhost:8080/assignments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": "ASM001",
  "title": "Build a Personal Portfolio",
  "description": "Create a responsive personal portfolio using HTML and CSS.",
  "course": "Web Development",
  "studentId": "STU001",
  "dueDate": "2026-09-30",
  "maxScore": 100,
  "status": "assigned",
  "submissionUrl": "none"
}

### Get all assignments
GET http://localhost:8080/assignments

### Get assignment by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/assignments/6aa5d8e8b3950be43a049d8f

