### Update assignment
PUT http://localhost:8080/assignments/6aa5d8e8b3950be43a049d8f
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": "ASM001",
  "title": "Build a Personal Portfolio - Updated",
  "description": "Create a responsive personal portfolio using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.",
  "course": "Web Development",
  "studentId": "STU001",
  "dueDate": "2026-10-05",
  "maxScore": 100,
  "status": "submitted",
  "submissionUrl": "https://example.com/submission"
}


### Verify updated assignment
GET http://localhost:8080/assignments/6aa5d8e8b3950be43a049d8f

### Delete assignment
DELETE http://localhost:8080/assignments/6aa5d8e8b3950be43a049d8f

### Confirm assignment was deleted
GET http://localhost:8080/assignments/6aa5d8e8b3950be43a049d8f